{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "动画用示例 1 展示 O(n log n) 的“最小结尾”方法：依次处理每个数字，并用二分查找定位第一个大于等于它的位置。若找到该位置就替换，以便为后续递增序列留下更小的结尾；若找不到则追加，说明最长长度增加。最终 tails 有 4 个元素，因此最长严格递增子序列的长度为 4，但 tails 本身不一定是原数组中的实际子序列。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>最长递增子序列可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.cells{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:44px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;text-align:center;transition:background .25s,border-color .25s}\n.cell .value{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;color:#d4d4d4}\n.cell .label{margin-top:2px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.cell.active .value{color:#fff}\n.cell.done{border-color:#3794ff}\n.tails .cell{width:52px}\n.tails .cell.empty{border-style:dashed;color:#8d8d8d;background:#2d2d30}\n.tails .cell.probe{background:#493c16;border-color:#d7ba7d}\n.tails .cell.target{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;min-height:auto;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2a2d2e;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.status strong,.accent{color:#3794ff}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.swatch{width:10px;height:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;background:#2d2d30;display:inline-block}\n.swatch.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.swatch.search{background:#493c16;border-color:#d7ba7d}\n.rule{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.rule code{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}\n.progress{flex:1;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:4px}\n.progress-bar{width:0;height:100%;background:#3794ff;transition:width .3s}\n.step-count{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>最长递增子序列：维护最小结尾</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">nums = [10, 9, 2, 5, 3, 7, 101, 18]</span>。对每个数字，在 <span class=\"mono\">tails</span> 中二分查找第一个大于等于它的位置。</p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2 class=\"panel-title\">原数组：蓝色格表示当前处理的数字</h2>\n<div id=\"nums\" class=\"cells\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2 class=\"panel-title\">tails[len]：长度为 len + 1 的递增子序列，其最小结尾</h2>\n<div id=\"tails\" class=\"cells tails\"></div>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\">\n<span><i class=\"swatch current\"></i>当前数字 / 写入位置</span>\n<span><i class=\"swatch search\"></i>二分查找探测位置</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"controls\">\n<div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"progress\" class=\"progress-bar\"></div></div>\n<div id=\"stepCount\" class=\"step-count\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"rule\">\n<div><span class=\"accent\">替换</span>：存在 <code>tails[p] ≥ x</code> 时，替换最左侧的这个结尾。</div>\n<div><span class=\"accent\">追加</span>：所有结尾都小于 <code>x</code> 时，把 <code>x</code> 放到末尾，长度加一。</div>\n<div>严格递增要求使用“第一个 <code>≥ x</code>”的位置；因此相等元素只会替换，不会增加长度。</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst nums=[10,9,2,5,3,7,101,18];\nconst snapshots=[];\nlet work=[];\nfor(let i=0;i<nums.length;i++){\n  const x=nums[i];\n  let l=0,r=work.length;\n  const probes=[];\n  while(l<r){\n    const m=Math.floor((l+r)/2);\n    probes.push(m);\n    if(work[m]>=x) r=m; else l=m+1;\n  }\n  const before=[...work];\n  const action=l===work.length?'追加':'替换';\n  if(action==='追加') work.push(x); else work[l]=x;\n  snapshots.push({i,x,before,after:[...work],pos:l,action,probes});\n}\nconst numsEl=document.getElementById('nums');\nconst tailsEl=document.getElementById('tails');\nconst statusEl=document.getElementById('status');\nconst progressEl=document.getElementById('progress');\nconst countEl=document.getElementById('stepCount');\nnums.forEach((v,i)=>{\n  const cell=document.createElement('div');\n  cell.className='cell';\n  cell.innerHTML='<div class=\"value\">'+v+'</div><div class=\"label\">下标 '+i+'</div>';\n  numsEl.appendChild(cell);\n});\nlet step=0,phase=0,timer;\nfunction draw(){\n  const s=snapshots[step];\n  [...numsEl.children].forEach((el,i)=>el.className='cell '+(i===step?'active':i<step?'done':''));\n  tailsEl.innerHTML='';\n  const values=phase===2?s.after:s.before;\n  const size=Math.max(values.length,phase===2?s.after.length:values.length,1);\n  for(let i=0;i<size;i++){\n    const cell=document.createElement('div');\n    let cls='cell';\n    if(phase===1&&s.probes.includes(i)) cls+=' probe';\n    if(phase===2&&i===s.pos) cls+=' target';\n    if(i>=values.length) cls+=' empty';\n    cell.className=cls;\n    cell.innerHTML='<div class=\"value\">'+(i<values.length?values[i]:'—')+'</div><div class=\"label\">长度 '+(i+1)+'</div>';\n    tailsEl.appendChild(cell);\n  }\n  if(phase===0){\n    statusEl.innerHTML='读取 <strong class=\"mono\">nums['+s.i+'] = '+s.x+'</strong>，准备在当前 tails 中寻找写入位置。';\n  }else if(phase===1){\n    const p=s.probes.length?s.probes.join(' → '):'无需探测（tails 为空）';\n    statusEl.innerHTML='二分探测下标: <strong class=\"mono\">'+p+'</strong>. '+(s.action==='追加'?'不存在大于等于 '+s.x+' 的结尾, 插入末尾位置 '+s.pos+'.':'第一个大于等于 '+s.x+' 的结尾位于下标 '+s.pos+'.');\n  }else{\n    statusEl.innerHTML='<strong>'+s.action+'：</strong>在位置 <strong class=\"mono\">'+s.pos+'</strong> 写入 <strong class=\"mono\">'+s.x+'</strong>。当前 tails = <strong class=\"mono\">['+s.after.join(', ')+']</strong>，已知最长长度为 <strong class=\"mono\">'+s.after.length+'</strong>。';\n  }\n  progressEl.style.width=(((step*3+phase+1)/(snapshots.length*3))*100)+'%';\n  countEl.textContent='第 '+(step+1)+' / '+snapshots.length+' 个数字';\n}\nfunction advance(){\n  draw();\n  clearTimeout(timer);\n  timer=setTimeout(()=>{\n    if(phase<2){phase++;}\n    else if(step<snapshots.length-1){step++;phase=0;}\n    else{step=0;phase=0;}\n    advance();\n  },1800);\n}\nadvance();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
,"time_complexity":"O(n log n)","space_complexity":"O(n)","complexity_note":"n 为数组长度. 每个数字在 tails 中二分查找一次; tails 最多保存 n 个最小结尾, 不需要存储全部子序列."}
